[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-SRS023
TITLE: Hand the pattern to enroute as one continuous track
STATEMENT: >>>
The aircraft shall hand the pattern position, altitude, and heading to the enroute step without a position jump, and shall publish a truth track for that continuous motion. More than one aircraft shall be able to publish a track in the same step. Acceptance is a pattern position whose first enroute latitude, longitude, and altitude match the pattern state.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The pattern and the great-circle leg are one flight. A jump would invent a track the tower never saw.
<<<
DAL: C
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: High-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The Aircraft CSCI is a simulation. It is not connected to a real aircraft or a live facility, and this track does not claim certification authority approval.
